<rss version="0.92"><channel><item>
            <title>[LU-20505] sanity-lfsck test_5 ldiskfs: Fail to generate linkEA</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20505</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;This issue was created by maloo for Andreas Dilger &amp;lt;adilger@dilger.ca&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This issue relates to the following test suite run: &lt;a href="https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/807c55f0-d570-446e-81a1-88ab752cee6d" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/807c55f0-d570-446e-81a1-88ab752cee6d&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;test_5 failed with the following error:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;lfs fid2path: cannot find /mnt/lustre [0x200005221:0x53:0x0]: No data available
(13) Fail to generate linkEA: [0x200005221:0x53:0x0] 
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Test session details:&lt;br/&gt;
clients: &lt;a href="https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/127607" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/127607&lt;/a&gt; - 5.14.0-687.17.1.el9_8.x86_64&lt;br/&gt;
servers: &lt;a href="https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/127607" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/127607&lt;/a&gt; - 5.14.0-687.17.1.el9_8_lustre.x86_64&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The mds1 console log reports an &lt;tt&gt;-ENOENT&lt;/tt&gt; error just before the test fails:&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href="https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_logs/bf470efe-9413-4a7f-b3f5-4dfc6a812649/show_text" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_logs/bf470efe-9413-4a7f-b3f5-4dfc6a812649/show_text&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;mdd_dir_page_build()) lustre-MDT0000-mdtlov: build page failed for [0x200005221:0x1:0x0]: rc = -2
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is failing only on ldiskfs, because this subtest is always skipped on ZFS "&lt;tt&gt;OI Scrub not implemented for ZFS&lt;/tt&gt;"&lt;/p&gt;








